  <title type="string">An exhibition of nothing, on purpose</title>
  <description type="string">The artist talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</description>
  <genre type="string">narrative</genre>
